Third-party text (the evidence-typing benchmark):
  benchmarks/evidence_typing/sample.jsonl holds the titles and abstracts of 478
  open-access articles, retrieved from Europe PMC, each under the licence its own
  article states: CC BY 4.0 (386), CC BY 3.0 (45), CC BY with no version stated (46)
  or CC0 1.0 (1). Each record names its authors, journal, year, DOI, PMID, PMCID,
  licence, licence URL or statement, and copyright line. Abstract markup was removed
  (section headings kept, followed by a colon); the text is otherwise unchanged.
  tests/fixtures/evidence_typing holds 11 of the same records. Their publication
  types and MeSH headings are from PubMed (U.S. National Library of Medicine), used
  as metadata; NLM does not endorse this use.

